    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 hellish stages.</strong><br><strong>Cute, but vicious traps.</strong><br><strong>The goal is simple: reach the exit alive.</strong><br><strong>Just... you might die about 372 times on the way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Can You Clear up to 100 Stages?&quot;</strong> isn\u2019t just a simple jump-and-run game.<br>It\u2019s a hardcore platformer that demands precise controls, lightning-fast reflexes, and unshakable determination in the face of endless failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll take control of a charming little character in a cozy pixel-art world.<br>But behind every tiny step lies a deadly trap or cruel trick.<br>One small mistake \u2014 back to the beginning.<br>Die over and over, and slowly refine your perfect movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Brutal Challenge</strong><br>Move and jump. A devilish design unfolds with just two controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Uniquely Crafted Stages</strong><br>No lazy repetition. Each level introduces new themes and trap mechanics that force you to think, adapt, and conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Death, Instant Retry</strong><br>Die and respawn instantly \u2014 no loading, no downtime. Pure focus, pure practice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Charm + Cute Aesthetics</strong><br>Retro-style visuals, adorable characters, and upbeat music make it all feel light and fun...<br>until the spikes come out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for Streamers and Masochists</strong><br>Fast runs, high difficulty, clean UI. Watching you suffer is half the entertainment!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 hellish stages.</strong><br><strong>Cute, but vicious traps.</strong><br><strong>The goal is simple: reach the exit alive.</strong><br><strong>Just... you might die about 372 times on the way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Can You Clear up to 100 Stages?&quot;</strong> isn\u2019t just a simple jump-and-run game.<br>It\u2019s a hardcore platformer that demands precise controls, lightning-fast reflexes, and unshakable determination in the face of endless failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll take control of a charming little character in a cozy pixel-art world.<br>But behind every tiny step lies a deadly trap or cruel trick.<br>One small mistake \u2014 back to the beginning.<br>Die over and over, and slowly refine your perfect movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Brutal Challenge</strong><br>Move and jump. A devilish design unfolds with just two controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Uniquely Crafted Stages</strong><br>No lazy repetition. Each level introduces new themes and trap mechanics that force you to think, adapt, and conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Death, Instant Retry</strong><br>Die and respawn instantly \u2014 no loading, no downtime. Pure focus, pure practice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Charm + Cute Aesthetics</strong><br>Retro-style visuals, adorable characters, and upbeat music make it all feel light and fun...<br>until the spikes come out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for Streamers and Masochists</strong><br>Fast runs, high difficulty, clean UI. Watching you suffer is half the entertainment!</p></li></ul>",
